Whenever you hear someone’s political analysis contain “The Republicans…” “The Democrats…” you can be sure they have no grasp on how DC works.
&quot;<p>I&#x27;m not giving political analysis, retard. But you are clearly so smart and clever. Tell us all about the &#x27;Snowden reporting&#x27; that president Obama personally proposed and executed. Not sure why he is reporting on himself but mister user seven numbers is sure to be a source of truth

Another version if this if the 301 is too much is to just close the connection then have a daemon or cron job shove their IP into a NFTables ipset or blackhole route them.  Be sure to have exclusion elements so one can not block their own gateway or corporate SNAT groups.<p><pre><code>    location ~* &#x2F;(xmlrpc|wp-login\.php|wp-admin) { set $ban 1; return 444 &#x27;&#x27;; }

    # grep banip &#x2F;etc&#x2F;nginx.conf
    log_format banip &#x27;$remote_addr&#x27;;

    # grep banip &#x2F;etc&#x2F;nginx&#x2F;http.d&#x2F;some-server.conf
    access_log &#x2F;var&#x2F;log&#x2F;nginx&#x2F;ban.log banip if=$ban;</code></pre>
